# Trace query — fragmented state churn root-cause ranking
#
# Coverage target: root_cause_rank should let fragmented state_churn compete
# with normal scheduler/blocking causes and promote the dominant cumulative
# state when no single long segment exists.
ID="trace_query_state_churn_root_cause_rank"
NAME="trace query — state_churn root cause rank"
QUESTION="请优先使用 trace_query 的 root_cause_rank 分析 11.0s 到 11.008s 的丢帧窗口。这里没有单个长 runnable/sleep/D/running 阻塞，而是 app-20 和 rival-30 频繁短片段切换；请判断 state_churn 是否应作为主因、主导状态是什么、累计影响是多少，并解释为什么下一步应看同 CPU 竞争/CPU pressure。"
HTRACE='# tracer: nop
#           TASK-PID   CPU#    TIMESTAMP  FUNCTION
        app-20   (   20) [001] .... 11.000000: sched_switch: prev_comm=idle/1 prev_pid=0 prev_prio=120 prev_state=R ==> next_comm=app next_pid=20 next_prio=53
